            "notes": "#### Round 1 \n\nStarting out you almost always want [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) unless you're playing into [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6), in which case you'll want to pick up [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49), this is because it offers much better consistent damage as it cannot be eaten by Defense Matrix. \n\nFrom the start of the game YOU are the threat to watch out for. You can one shot any character that isnt the tank. Protect your backline from dive tanks, farm cash, make sure you're tossing your shields for poke when you know you can't dive anytime soon.![Video Showcasing Brig 1 shot using round 1 build, showing specifically Mei being combo'd.](https://i.imgur.com/thjomqW.jpg)\n\n###### Items \n\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n- [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)  \n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)",
