            "notes": "#### Round 2 \n\nYou absolutely HAVE to pick up [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) here unless you're absolutely dirt poor from round 1. It gives so much ult gen for free and enables the entire rally spam build concept with Skoeld. If you have extra cash fill in with the blues. \n\n###### Items \n\n- [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) \n\n###### Optional Items \n\n- [Omni-Boost](item_632bd990-4523-4b3f-b08a-6dd11280c6f9) as mentioned previously, helps close the distance against Sigma and is just a good item to help you escape \n- [Squire's Satchel](item_b530e529-3bf4-4b7c-abe8-6e976a5c35bf) Good survival item even without Lindholm Wall.\n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) \n- [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e)",
