            "notes": "#### Round 3 \nWe have a huge potential powerspike, you can go a few roads here, you can grab [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) for really good survivability especially later with [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0)or you can go [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) (which does work with Skoeld) for really good poke damage before an engage. I personally prefer [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0). \n\n##### Powers \n\n- [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) \n- [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) \n\n###### Items \n\n- [Dragon's Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) \n\n###### Optional Items \n\n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) \n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) \n- [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e)\n[Image](https://i.imgur.com/zDGW5qB.jpg)",
